# Infrastructure

## Docker

- Use lightweight multi-arch images (Apple Silicon included). Prefer `eclipse-temurin:17-jre-jammy` / `maven:3.9.9-eclipse-temurin-17`. Avoid `*-alpine` Temurin tags — they often have no `linux/arm64` manifest.
- Do not bake secrets into images.

## Kubernetes

- Set `imagePullPolicy: IfNotPresent` for local testing.
- Use Kubernetes Services for App → Redis and App → Postgres. Never hardcode pod IPs.

## Helm

Parameterize in `values.yaml`:

- database credentials (via secrets/values, not committed plaintext prod secrets)
- image version
- replica count (must support >1 replica so cache consistency can be proven)

Keep Redis and Postgres as chart/services the app Deployment talks to by Service DNS.
